:: Millers Babysitting Isaiah Computer [nobr]

/* Intro */
You stand in front of <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span>’s unlocked PC, wondering if the boy had been on it just before leaving and forgot to turn it off or even put it to sleep. Maybe he figures you wouldn’t go into his room to snoop, as a normal person wouldn’t, but you also convince yourself of the possibility that he left it on intentionally for you just in case you wanted to use it. Sure, he didn’t mention that he did that, but it could still be a possibility. <span style="Color: Yellow">With the possibility of it in your mind, you sit down and wiggle the mouse to turn the screen on.</span> <br>

