    You read the full post, seeing what <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> asked. It mentioned how he’s always liked girls and even had one or two girlfriends, but since he’s started this new school year, he’s found that he started growing feelings for one particular boy. <span style="Color: Pink">Your heart stops as you wonder who he is talking about, scanning the post for any information to identify who <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Isaiah</span> is crushing on, but find nothing.</span> It simply ends with asking the question of whether it’s okay for boys to like both boys and girls. He only posted it a few hours ago, and so far, there are no responses. <br>
